              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "invius, invia, invium — \"without roads, pathless, impassable\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Silva magna et invia est; equī trānsīre nōn possunt. The wood is big and pathless; the horses cannot get through."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "An adjective of three endings, from in- 'not' and via 'road'."
            }
          ]
        },
