          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "invius is built from in- 'not' and via 'road' (EtymDB; Lewis & Short): without a road, so hard to pass."
            }
          ]
        },
